sp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;2010년 8월 25일<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 145%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;기획재정</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">부장관</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"top\" width=\"373\" height=\"938\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 62.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -60.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">1. 시험목적</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">우리 정부의 경비부담으로 세계은행(World Bank)에</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"> 1년 내지 2년간 파견되어 근무할 초급전문가(JPO : Junior Professional Officer)를 선발</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 62.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -60.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">2. 선발인원 : 2명</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 62.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -60.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">3. 모집분야</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -35.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>o&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">①경제･경영･정책･국제관계, ②사회개발, ③농촌개발, </span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -35.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;④인적</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">자원 개발, ⑤통계, ⑥엔지니어링, </span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -35.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;⑦환경, ⑧보건･위생</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">4. 시험일정</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 시험일시 및 장소 </span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">o</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">1차 시험(서류전형) </span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 47.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -45.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>-</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\"> 원서접수 마감일 현재까지 유효한 영어시험(TEPS) 900점</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"> 이상의 성적표를 응시서류 접수기간에 제출(TEPS 정기시험의 성적 유효기간은 응시일로부터 2년)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 47.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -45.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 49.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -47.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>* TEPS 정기시험 성적만을 인정하고, 정부기관․민간회사․</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\">학교 등에서 승진․연수․입사․입학(졸업)등의 특정 목적으로</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"> 실시하는 TEPS 수시․특별시험 등은 인정되지 않음</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 50.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -48.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">o</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">2차 시험(종합평가)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 50.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -48.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>-</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\"> 일시 및 장소 : 추후공고(2010년 12월초 시행 예정/ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">1차 시험 합격자 발표시 공고 예정)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 합격자 발표</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">o</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"> 일자&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>- 1차 시험 : 2010년 11월 10일(수)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>- 2차 시험 : 추후공지(2010년 12월초)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">o</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"> 합격자수</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 48.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>- 1차 시험 : TEPS 성적 900점 이상 획득자중 최종선발인원의 10배수 내외의 범위에서 고득점자순으로 선발</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>- 2차 시험 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">JPO 2명</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">o</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"> 발표방법&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">- 기획재정부 홈페이지(www.mosf.go.kr) 공고&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">* 1차 및 2차 시험 합격자에게 개별통보도 병행&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">5. 시험방법</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 1차 시험 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">: 서류전형(상기 ‘4-나’항 참조)<br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 2차 시험 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">종합평가(100점 만점)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">o</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"> 국･영어 면접(40점), 영어필기(30점), 영어토론(30점)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">*</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"> 영어필기는 영어작문능력 및 국제기구/국제현안에 관한</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"> 전문지식을 평가</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"top\" width=\"369\" height=\"938\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">6. 응시자격</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: -3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 국적</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"> : 대한민국</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 55.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -53.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">&nbsp;나. 학력</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"> : 지원업무와 관련한 석사 학위를 소지하고 최소 2년 이상 업무경력을 보유한 자 또는 박사학위 소지자</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 50.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -48.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>* </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">석사졸업 예정자 지원가능(단, 최종합격 발표시까지 졸업증명서 미제출시에는 합격 취소)</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">&nbsp;다. 연령</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"> : 1979년 1월 1일 이후 출생자</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">&nbsp;라. 병역</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"> : 남자의 경우 병역필 또는 면제자<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">* 단, 국가공무원법 제33조 각호의 1에 해당하는 자는 응시 불가</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">7. 응시서류 접수</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가.</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\"> 접수기간<br>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">2010년 10월 11일(월)～10월 25일(월) (공휴일 제외)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">오전 9시～12시 및 오후 2시～5시</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 접수처 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">기획재정부 국제기구과(정부과천청사 1동 511호)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -28.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">o</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\"> 우편접수시 아래 주소로 2010년 10월 25일(월) 오후 5시까지</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"> 도착해야 함.</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 51.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -49.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>- 경기도 과천시 관문로 88 정부과천청사 기획재정부 국제금융국 국제기구과(511호) (우편번호 : 427-725)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 제출서류</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 50.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -48.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">o</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"> 응시원서(반드시 반명함판 사진 3장 부착)</span></p>\n        