nbsp;o 경력증명서</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 33.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -31.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;o 병역증명서(남자에 한함)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 49.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -47.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>*</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">모든 증명서는 반드시 원본 제출</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 50.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -48.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>*</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\"> 1차 합격자는 자기소개서(국문 및 영문)를 2010년 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">11월 25일(목) 오후 5시까지 우편 또는 이메일로 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">기획재정부 국제기구과에 제출</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">8. 참고사항</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 파견비용 </span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 29.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -27.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>o 세계은행과의 협정에 의거하여 우리정부가 보수 및 행정비용을</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"> 전액 부담</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -28.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>o</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">JPO가</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\"> 가족을 동반하는 경우, 동반가족으로 인하여 추가로</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"> 발생하는 일체의 경비는 JPO 본인이 부담</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 27.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -25.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 파견기간</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"> : 1년으로 하되, </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">1년후 근무성적을 기초로 제반</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">사정 및 세계은행과의 협의 결과를 감안하여, 기획재정부</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">장관이 추가 1년 연장여부를 결정</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 27.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -25.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">9. 문의처<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\"><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>o 기획재정</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">부 국제금융국 국제기구과(시험 주관)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">전화 : (02)2150-4836</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">E-mail : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">ifi</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">@</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">mosf.go.kr</span></p>\